        <item>
            <title>3.5.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 00:03:57 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>162</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- The last pane can now be closed: its header shows the close button even when it is the only pane, and closing it returns to the launch screen. The session stays in the Open list.
- New **File > Stop Session** (Cmd+Opt+W) stops the focused pane's session, the same as Stop in the pane's close menu.

### Changes
- Cmd+W now always closes the focused pane, whether one pane is open or several. It no longer ends the session when only one pane is left; use Stop Session or the close menu for that. The menu item is renamed **Close Pane**.

### Bug Fixes
- Closing a pane that showed another Mac's session kept the connection open, so that Mac could never stop the session for being idle. It now detaches.
]]></description>
