        <item>
            <title>3.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 19:28:18 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>161</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Stop a session running on another Mac. A pane attached to another Mac's session, and that Mac's rows in the sidebar, now offer "Stop session on <Mac>", which ends it there for every client instead of only detaching this pane.
- Choose how to close a pane. A small menu next to the pane header's × offers Close pane, Close session and Stop session, and the pane header's right-click menu ends with the same choices.

### Changes
- While a stop is in progress the pane shows "Stopping Session", and its Stop items are disabled until the other Mac answers.
- If the answer to a stop is lost, Canopy asks that Mac whether the session is still running before reporting a failure.
]]></description>
